s not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[284,597,598],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[332,601],{"name":602},"select-menu-search",[306,604,606],{"id":605},"variants","Variants",[281,608,609,610,613,614,351,617,620,621,330],{},"Uses the ",[284,611,612],{},"variant",", ",[284,615,616],{},"color",[284,618,619],{},"highlight"," of ",[284,622,570],{},[332,624],{"name":625},"select-menu-variant",[306,627,629],{"id":628},"icon","Icon",[281,631,609,632,351,634,620,637,639,640,642,643,645],{},[284,633,628],{},[284,635,636],{},"trailing-icon",[284,638,570],{},"; ",[284,641,628],{}," shows on the left, and ",[284,644,636],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[332,647],{"name":648},"select-menu-icon",[306,650,652],{"id":651},"size-and-states","Size and states",[281,654,655,656,659],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[293,657,87],{"href":658},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[332,661],{"name":662},"select-menu-states",[301,664,666],{"id":665},"examples","Examples",[306,668,670],{"id":669},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[281,672,673,674,676,677,680,681,676,683,330],{},"An empty single selection is ",[284,675,321],{},", so use ",[284,678,679],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[284,682,329],{},[284,684,685],{},"requiredArray",[332,687],{"name":688},"select-menu-validation",[306,690,692],{"id":691},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[281,694,695,696,699,700,291,703,707],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[293,697,202],{"href":698},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[284,701,702],{},"ui.wrapper",[293,704,706],{"href":705},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[332,709],{"name":710},"select-menu-truncate",[306,712,714],{"id":713},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[281,716,717,718,721,722,724,725,728],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[284,719,720],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[284,723,416],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[284,726,727],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[332,730],{"name":731},"select-menu-async",[306,733,735],{"id":734},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[281,737,738,739,741],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[284,740,416],{}," are computed from the city.",[332,743],{"name":744},"select-menu-cascade",[306,746,748],{"id":747},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[281,750,751,752,755,756,759],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[284,753,754],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[284,757,758],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[332,761],{"name":762},"select-menu-expose",[301,764,766],{"id":765},"props","Props",[768,769],"component-props",{"name":389},[281,771,772,773,776,777,613,780,613,783,613,785,613,788,351,791,330],{},"See ",[293,774,87],{"href":775},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[284,778,779],{},"size",[284,781,782],{},"disabled",[284,784,720],{},[284,786,787],{},"skeleton",[284,789,790],{},"id",[284,792,793],{},"name",[281,795,796,797,800,801,351,804,807],{},"When ",[284,798,799],{},"open"," is not set, the user opens and closes the menu; there is no v-model for it. The types of ",[284,802,803],{},"clear",[284,805,806],{},"clearIcon"," are inferred from another Nuxt UI generic that this component does not provide, so they are not in its types.",[301,809,811],{"id":8